{
  "id": "w25a",
  "title": "W25a Mac references: the command bar's history rows",
  "about": "Kite for Mac from origin/fix/test-safe-text-input: main plus the test-safe text fix (#374), which typed text needs (W25a changes no Mac code). One state: Ctrl+T's bar over windows/helix/states/command-bar-history.json (sidebar.json with the engine's suggestions off, so no network rows), with windows/helix/states/command-bar-history.history.json (helix/W25a-history b0cf56c, inlined here) as the profile's history.json, and \"recipe\" typed into the bar opened by a click on New Tab. The Windows capture is Kite.exe --capture --window-size 1280,820 --capture-scale 2 --command-bar recipe on the same two files.",
  "base": "origin/fix/test-safe-text-input",
  "window_size": [
    1280,
    820
  ],
  "session": {
    "ref": "origin/helix/W25a-history",
    "path": "windows/helix/states/command-bar-history.json"
  },
  "tree_match": "SuggestionRowView",
  "expect_frames": [],
